   = help: the trait `TakesScalar` is not implemented for `vitaminc_aead::typed::List<i32>`
   = note: `vitaminc_aead::typed::List<i32>` is the sink that builds this target, and that sink does not build its value from one scalar
   = note: one ciphertext decrypts into a scalar such as `String`, `i64`, or `Vec<u8>`, or into an `Option`, a `Protected`, or a derived newtype of a scalar
   = note: to decrypt many values, decrypt a `Vec<Ciphertext>`: each ciphertext becomes one element
   = note: to decrypt a sequence, a map, or a struct that was encrypted as a tree, use `decrypt_tree`
   = help: the following other types implement trait `TakesScalar`:
             Optional<T>
             OwnedFrameSink
             ProtectedOptional<T>
             ScalarProtected<T>
             ScalarSink<T>
             Wrap<S>
             Wrapped<S, W>
   = note: required for `Optional<Vec<i32>>` to implement `TakesScalar`
   = note: required for `Option<Vec<i32>>` to implement `ScalarTarget`
